  "solution": "The logic followed here is:** (1st number)² + 1st number = 2nd number.**\n\n**1) 18 : 306 → (18)² + 18 = 324 + 18 = 342**\n\n2) 25 : 650 → (25)2 + 25 = 625 + 25 = 650\n\n3) 23 : 552 → (23)2 + 23 = 529 + 23 = 552\n\n4) 13: 182 → (13)2 + 13 = 169 + 13 = 182\n\nThus, 18 : 306 is odd number-pair.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"18 : 306\".**",
